WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — time-as-an-index (ha) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.598
<v Narrator>A farkon, a cikin wani lokaci na ma'adanai loop, kusan dukan digital kujera za su karya a lokaci guda sai dai da wani lokaci sirri pad.

2
00:00:10.678 --> 00:00:24.128
<v Narrator>Na biyu, a cikin kimiyyar lissafi da aka sani, babu wani kwayoyin cuta, analog circuit, ko kuma an yi rahoton rashin daidaito yana aika amsoshi masu karantawa baya a lokaci.

3
00:00:24.208 --> 00:00:35.390
<v Narrator>Na uku, duk wani bincike mai sauri na amsa a nan gaba shi ne aikin da aka biya gaba ɗaya, wanda kuma kimar ta atomatik za ta shafe shi nan take.
